data: {"id": "f69edcbff4304dc8-thinking-parallel_evidence-1358", "run_id": "f69edcbff4304dc8", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据采集结论\n\n**实体身份与生命周期**\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` (UID: `7f78dcbf-0a84-437d-b1c1-e376d407c9c0`)\n- **状态**: `Pending`，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因为 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n- **生命周期**: 未发生重启 (Restart Count: 0)，未进入 Running 阶段。\n\n**支持候选原因 (ImagePullFailed) 的事实**\n1.  **Prometheus Metrics**: 确认 `kube_pod_container_status_phase` 为 `Pending` (1)，且 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 明确返回 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n2.  **Kubernetes Events**: 原始错误日志显示：\n    `failed to pull and unpack ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788764887976, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

